{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"natlan_night_kingdom","name_zh":"夜神之国","name_en":"Night Kingdom","aliases":["夜神之国","Night Kingdom","大灵的国度","夜晚的国度","realm of the Wayob","kingdom of the Lord of the Night"],"category":"cosmology","scope":"regional","regions":["Natlan"],"summary":"夜神之国是位于纳塔地下深处的魂灵国度，也是以旧地脉残片重建而成的纳塔地脉网络。纳塔亡者与大灵居于其中，其规则涉及灵魂归宿、古名与还魂诗。它曾长期遭受深渊侵蚀；深渊威胁解除后，「队长」与夜神合二为一，使夜神获得永恒生命，并改写了原本排斥外来灵魂的规则。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"nk_fact_001","text":"夜神之国位于纳塔地下深处，是大灵与亡者灵魂所在的国度，也被描述为介于肉体与心智、生命与死亡之间的边界空间。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期性质","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_night_kingdom","fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01"]},{"fact_id":"nk_fact_002","text":"夜神之国实际承担着纳塔地脉的功能；纳塔原有地脉严重破损，缺乏其他地区那样稳定且根系深厚的地脉。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"夜神之国建立后","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_night_kingdom","fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01","local_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01","local_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_02"]},{"fact_id":"nk_fact_003","text":"夜神是夜神之国的构建者。她整合旧地脉的残片并重构其脉络，由此建立夜神之国；其他残留的天使也为这次重构献出了力量。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"远古时期","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01","fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_03","local_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_02"]},{"fact_id":"nk_fact_004","text":"初代火神希巴拉克后来强化了夜神之国，并建立用于对抗深渊的规则，其中包括还魂诗与归火圣夜巡礼。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"夜神之国初建之后","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01","fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_03","local_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_02"]},{"fact_id":"nk_fact_005","text":"纳塔人死后会进入夜神之国，并最终失去自我意识，与其中的灵魂之海融为一体。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"规则改写前后均无相反证据","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_night_kingdom","fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01"]},{"fact_id":"nk_fact_006","text":"持有古名者若在战斗中身亡，并且其队伍战胜深渊，便可经由还魂诗复生。若因战败而死且未能复生，其古名将永久失落；若因其他情况死亡，则会在纳塔以不同形态重生。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"希巴拉克建立相关规则之后","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_night_kingdom","fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01"]},{"fact_id":"nk_fact_007","text":"夜神之国没有记录旅行者在纳塔之外的事迹，因此这些事迹无法直接用于其古名的制作；相关人员认为需要夜神协助，才能将这些经历记录进去。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"为旅行者制作古名期间","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_night_kingdom","fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01"]},{"fact_id":"nk_fact_008","text":"重建后的夜神之国没有与其他国家的地脉重新连通。规则改写以前，它通常不接纳非纳塔原住民的灵魂，仅有极少数例外。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"重建后至「队长」牺牲前","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_night_kingdom","fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01","local_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_03"]},{"fact_id":"nk_fact_009","text":"五百年前的灾厄期间，夜神之国被深渊力量侵入。此后数百年间，大灵持续对抗深渊，力量因而衰减，与纳塔人的沟通也受到阻碍。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"五百年前至旅行者抵达纳塔初期","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_night_kingdom","fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01","local_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01"]},{"fact_id":"nk_fact_010","text":"旅行者抵达纳塔初期，玛薇卡判断夜神之国的状况已极度恶化，并估计纳塔的「寿命」很可能不足一年。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"第五章第二幕期间","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_night_kingdom","fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01","local_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01"]},{"fact_id":"nk_fact_011","text":"古斯托特被消灭后，夜神之国中的深渊影响被清除，夜神随后返回其中维持地脉。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"第五章第五幕末期","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_night_kingdom","fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01","local_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_03"]},{"fact_id":"nk_fact_012","text":"「队长」代替玛薇卡献出生命，并与夜神合二为一。夜神由此获得永恒生命，夜神之国的地脉规则也被改写，使其能够接纳纳塔以外之人的灵魂。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"第五章第五幕末期及其后","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_night_kingdom","fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01","fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_03","local_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_03"]},{"fact_id":"nk_fact_013","text":"深渊战争后，旅行者的血亲进入夜神之国，利用其重建地脉的经验与「命运的织机」重新编织坎瑞亚的地脉。此过程令纳塔地脉出现类似「杂音」的现象，但茜特菈莉当时未发现它对地脉或夜神之国造成实质影响。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"第五章第六幕期间","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01","fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_03","local_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_04"]}],"timeline":[{"period":"葬火之战后至远古纳塔早期","order_hint":10,"events":["纳塔原有地脉严重破损后，夜神整合旧地脉残片并重构其脉络，建立了夜神之国。","希巴拉克随后强化夜神之国，并建立还魂诗与归火圣夜巡礼等对抗深渊的规则。"],"current_status":"夜神之国由此成为纳塔特有的地脉网络与魂灵国度。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01","fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_03","local_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_02"]},{"period":"五百年前的灾厄及其后数百年","order_hint":20,"events":["深渊力量侵入夜神之国。","大灵长期抵抗深渊，力量不断衰减，与纳塔人的沟通受阻。"],"current_status":"至旅行者抵达纳塔初期，夜神之国已接近彻底失守，玛薇卡估计纳塔可能不足一年便会毁灭。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01","local_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01"]},{"period":"第五章第五幕末期","order_hint":30,"events":["古斯托特被消灭后，夜神之国中的深渊影响得到清除。","「队长」代替玛薇卡献出生命并与夜神合二为一，使夜神获得永恒生命，同时改写夜神之国的地脉规则。"],"current_status":"夜神返回夜神之国维持地脉；夜神之国现可接纳纳塔以外之人的灵魂。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01","fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_03","local_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_03"]},{"period":"深渊战争后、第五章第六幕期间","order_hint":40,"events":["旅行者的血亲进入夜神之国，借助其重建经验与「命运的织机」重新编织坎瑞亚地脉。"],"current_status":"纳塔地脉一度出现类似「杂音」的现象，但当时未发现其对夜神之国造成实质影响。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01","fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_03","local_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_04"]}],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"纳塔人可能普遍知道夜神之国与大灵、亡者和还魂诗有关，并将其视为死后灵魂的归处；其重建史、地脉结构、外来灵魂限制及规则改写过程则需要更高层级的知识。","likely_known_by":["夜神与大灵","纳塔历代火神及参与地脉计划者","烟谜主中研究灵魂、地脉与古名的人士","古名持有者及亲历夜神之国者","了解还魂诗传统的纳塔各部族成员"],"unlikely_known_by":["纳塔以外国家的普通居民","未接触地脉、古名或大灵事务的普通人","不了解第五章相关秘密行动的人士"],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":["将夜神之国视为与其他地区完全相同的普通地脉并不准确；它是利用旧地脉残片重建的特殊网络，且长期未与其他国家连通。","认为夜神之国至今仍绝不接纳外来者灵魂已经过时；「队长」牺牲后，其规则已被改写。"]},"activation_keys":["夜神之国","Night Kingdom"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["夜神之国的开放世界可达性、任务与秘境入口清单","大灵显化身的等级数值、抗性、生命值、攻击力与防御力","敌人技能倍率、护盾数据、元素附着、能量恢复和战斗攻略","掉落物、成就、奖励及玩家操作说明"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["将Xibalba认定为夜神之国的另一个名称；现有文本仅提出可能性和神话类比。","根据壁画推测夜神过去的外貌、体型或具体身体特征。","BWiki独有的「最后一位天使融入地脉古树」等起源细节，未得到Fandom正文或local_dialogue直接支持，未作为事实采用。"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_natlan_night_kingdom","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Night Kingdom","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Night_Kingdom","language":"en","revision_id":"2115456","source_text_sha256":"a18684ec709fae67f6ac1beb8be251c6a59535a48ba006e32b1a769825d116c3"},{"source_id":"bwiki_natlan_night_kingdom","provider":"bwiki","role":"cross_language_verification","title":"夜神之国","url":"https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/%E5%A4%9C%E7%A5%9E%E4%B9%8B%E5%9B%BD","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"620980","source_text_sha256":"0b8ca25d9fbacfb92bf16244700784b14d069c6591e201fdcb332da01e9afbb0"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Night Kingdom","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Night_Kingdom","language":"en","revision_id":"2115456","source_text_sha256":"d8ac6f11c753e5c5b231aa07ee26cc037171a8bd79afa1443bf23f12a594fbfa"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_03","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Yohualtecuhtin, Lord of the Night","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Yohualtecuhtin%2C_Lord_of_the_Night","language":"en","revision_id":"2109116","source_text_sha256":"bdd25a30d084aa5f6ce778a950614b4409b543e7332cfac3c515c25caafe354c"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_04","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Flow-Inverted Wayob Manifestation","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Flow-Inverted_Wayob_Manifestation","language":"en","revision_id":"2135810","source_text_sha256":"a63f08007c7595c51258cc3f7d922e219794c14b2561b2124c1ee30ee35a9c8f"},{"source_id":"local_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_01","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"过去与未来","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_5007.json#unit=500702","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"f7b0c8d88d9e0de6adae20ba799cdc836ac1c7d3aa2a9250a403bf74b2796181"},{"source_id":"local_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_02","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"秘源之下","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_5009.json#unit=500911","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"36bd192aa092d4ca374521d17cc76ed519a1f5d0072510e69ee2e713b5e7bfbb"},{"source_id":"local_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_03","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"当一切镌刻成碑","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_5029.json#unit=502910","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"c510fda178030c25cb9e6c7567a2b7a17edcc235ebfda83ccf6543a6abd3995c"},{"source_id":"local_sup_natlan_night_kingdom_04","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"你所不在的时空","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_8018.json#unit=801804","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"71e7888e97395d10992dca1cf7b112a775c57a340ca621d7afa760a915a6a18f"}],"evidence_bundle_sha256":"e2745faf21ed651083952f53dc1a026354282886be0bc9b52a88c09f2c3ba5f5","review":{"cross_language_conflicts":[],"uncertain_claims":["玛薇卡关于纳塔「寿命」不足一年的说法属于角色依据推算作出的估计，已标记为reported。","深渊浸礼者进一步宣称坎瑞亚已经完成复国，但对话中该结论受到质疑，且不属于夜神之国本身的确定状态，因此未纳入事实。"],"missing_evidence":[],"needs_human_review":false}}